			],
			"Message": "refactor(Output): Reformat build configuration and expand webview diagnostics\n\nReformat the entire `Land/Element/Output` build configuration tree to align indentation and brace style with project standards, ensuring consistent formatting across `ESBuild` configurations, `Plugin` definitions, and `Polyfill` scripts. This includes standardized `__defProp` and `__name` helper injections and object property spacing.\n\nSimultaneously, enhance the `InjectWebviewRuntimeDiagnosticsInner` transform to inject deeper runtime diagnostics into extension webviews. Add a `MutationObserver` to track DOM mutations and snapshot body state, plus comprehensive hooks for `ReactDOM` (`createRoot`, `render`) to capture React lifecycle errors, container details, and window React key dumps. This enables granular diagnosis of webview bootstrapping failures and silent render crashes under the WKWebView/Tauri runtime.\n\nThe generated `Configuration` artifacts are updated to reflect the source changes and ensure the build pipeline remains consistent.\n\nImpact: Standardizes codebase formatting and provides critical observability for debugging extension webview integration issues.",
